{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1485830-do-antagonists-get-weapons","id":1485830,"title":"Do Antagonists get weapons?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-07-05T04:41:32-07:00","id":1485830,"title":"Do Antagonists get weapons?","content":"OMG I'm actually a bit embarrassed at having to ask this after so long (and I've been running a game for ages!) but it's a possibly stupid question that has only just occurred to me.<br /> <br /> Do Antagonists get weapons? Like if your Beat Cop draws on a Hero and shoots are we adding the variables from the various weapons tags of a pistol to his pools or are they considered &quot;all wrapped in&quot; to the pool itself? Which is kind of what I've been assuming, but it occurs to me on re-reading that I may have been short-changing those poor, poor bad guys my players have been beating on, even if I'm glad my players won of course.<br /> <br /> SMH. Thanks all.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2608-squee","name":"Squee","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2608_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"120"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-05T07:37:15-07:00","id":1485837,"title":"","content":"As a general rule it is wrapped in the pool, but the pool lack tags that once in a while may prove interesting.<br /> <br /> My suggestion is to use the pools and ignore details when dealing with most antagonists, and worry only with the important ones.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-05T13:00:28-07:00","id":1485856,"title":"","content":"If a weapon is important narratively to an antagonist, it's best to just use Qualities and Flairs to replace/replicate any relevant tags. There's already some of those that have this sort of function to them.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-16T17:15:07-07:00","id":1486699,"title":"","content":"Gah! Computer died. Thanks for the response guys. I feel marginally less bad for my poor antagonists.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2608-squee","name":"Squee","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpat